==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 4~16 seconds<sup>120f~480f</sup>.
*100 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
*1 [[Chief Peng]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Chief Peng]] spawns after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**200 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] to tank the hits while slowly defeating the Chief Pengs. note weight lifter cat is also good for the better defense and damage

